  "content": "\n## Complete Design System Package\n\n### Primer React\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://primer.style/design/\" />\n\n### Fluent UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://628d031b55e942004ac95df1-myxgspuuyt.chromatic.com/?path=/docs/concepts-introduction--page\" />\n\n### Atlassian Design System\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://atlassian.design/\" />\n\n### Reshaped\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://reshaped.so/\" />\n\n### MUI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://mui.com/\" />\n\n### React Spectrum\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://react-spectrum.adobe.com/react-spectrum/index.html\" />\n\n### UI Components Library\n\n## Astryx Design System\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://astryx.atmeta.com/\" />\n\n### Mantine\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://mantine.dev/\" />\n\n## Park UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://park-ui.com/\" />\n\n### Radix UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://www.radix-ui.com/\" />\n\n## [COSS.COM](http://COSS.COM) UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://coss.com/\" />\n\n## React Aria\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://react-spectrum.adobe.com/react-aria/index.html\" />\n\n### ariakit\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://ariakit.org/\" />\n\n### Chakura UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://chakra-ui.com/\" />\n\n### Rewind UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://rewind-ui.dev/\" />\n\n### React Component\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://react-component.github.io/badgeboard/\" />\n\n### Ant Design\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://ant.design/\" />\n\n### ARK UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://ark-ui.com/\" />\n\n### Sass UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://saas-ui.dev/\" />\n\n### Spark\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://sparkui.vercel.app/?path=/docs/getting-started--docs\" />\n\n### cult/ui\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://www.cult-ui.com/docs\" />\n\n### Retro UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://retroui.dev/\" />\n\n<p />\n\n### Origin UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://crafted.is/exp6\" />\n\n<p />\n\n### 21st.dev\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://21st.dev/\" />\n\n<p />\n\n### Magic UI\n\n<bookmark source=\"https://magicui.design/